          "features": {
            "displayValues": [
              "25% LIGHTER FOR YOUTH ATHLETES: Designed specifically for beginners. Weighing significantly less than a standard regulation volleyball, this lightweight design eliminates arm fatigue and stinging impacts, making it easier for younger players to master proper technique.",
              "OFFICIAL SIZE 5 TRAINING: Build correct muscle memory from day one. Despite its lighter, player-friendly weight, this ball maintains an official regulation size 5 footprint, ensuring athletes seamlessly transition to standard competitive gear as they grow.",
              "SENSI-TEC SOFT-TOUCH COVER: Play without pain. Featuring a premium Sensi-Tec microfiber composite leather cover, it delivers an ultra-cushioned, soft feel that protects sensitive hands and wrists during extended passing and serving drills.",
              "ENHANCED GRIP & PRECISION CONTROL: Minimize errors on the court. The advanced textured surface provides a superior, non-slip grip, giving coaches and new players maximum tactile control for precision setting, bumping, and targeted serving practice.",
              "IDEAL FOR BEGINNERS & LEAGUES: The perfect foundational tool. Built to withstand frequent use in schools, recreational programs, and junior club volleyball training, this durable ball is engineered to quickly advance fundamental skills."
            ],
            "label": "Features",
            "locale": "en_US"
